# Claude Code keeps its runtime in .claude: worktrees for isolated agents,
# sessions, local settings. Ignore all of it and re-include only the committed
# leaf symlinks, so anything a future version adds there is ignored by default.
# .claude itself must stay a real, mostly ignored directory: agent worktrees are
# created under the git-common-dir checkout's .claude/worktrees, and pointing
# that at tracked content puts a nested checkout inside the tree.
.claude/*
!.claude/CLAUDE.md
!.claude/skills
.ai/settings.local.json
